    <summary>Apple Mail to PST converter that turns .mbox and .emlx exports from a Mac into Outlook PST archives on a Windows PC, with a merge switch for one combined file or one PST per source.</summary>
    <description>This package installs an Apple Mail to PST converter for Windows that takes mail exported from a Mac and writes it into Outlook data files. Apple Mail gives you .mbox mailboxes and native .emlx messages, and the program reads either kind and builds a PST on the local machine. It fits a help desk or admin moving someone off a Mac onto Outlook on Windows, since the work stays on the PC and no message leaves it.

![Apple Mail to PST Converter Software screenshot 1](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/am2p/am2p-v1-main.png)

## How to use Apple Mail to PST Converter Software

1. Open the program after the package installs.
2. Add the .mbox or .emlx files copied over from the Mac, in any mix.
3. Set the Merge into one PST option, described below.
4. Choose the destination folder.
5. Run the job and load the PST into Outlook.

Trial note: the free trial converts a set of 20 emails or fewer completely, and for a bigger set it keeps every tenth message up to 100. A license ends that limit.

![Apple Mail to PST Converter Software screenshot 2](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/am2p/am2p-v1-done.png)

## What an .mbox or EMLX to PST conversion keeps

- Message subjects in Cyrillic, Latin and further alphabets, plus the From line and the timestamp.
- Both rich HTML layout and plain readings of each body.
- Every attachment, carried over bit for bit so nothing drops.
- One Unicode PST per output, which mounted cleanly in a 2016 build of Outlook.

## One PST per file, or a single combined archive

How the output is shaped depends on the Merge into one PST checkbox. Clear it and every file you load becomes a standalone PST. Tick it and the run joins the full list into one PST, with each source parked under its own top-level folder. Admins who run an apple mail to pst job over a batch of Apple Mail exports in a single pass pick whichever layout suits the handover, split or combined.

![Apple Mail to PST Converter Software screenshot 3](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/am2p/am2p-v1-convert.png)

## Who needs an EMLX to PST converter

- Admins who push the converter to workstations through Chocolatey while migrating a team from Mac to Outlook.
- Help desks handed a folder of .mbox and .emlx from a Mac that is being retired.
- People who keep old Apple Mail and want an emlx to pst copy they can read in Outlook on Windows.

## Trial and license

This is commercial software, and the package delivers its free trial, so full use needs a license. The trial caps how many messages convert, and a lifetime, 1-year or business license removes that cap. Terms are on the [Apple Mail to PST Converter Software](https://www.softorbits.net/apple-mail-to-pst-converter/?utm_source=chocolatey&amp;utm_medium=package) page.

## FAQ

### How do I export Apple Mail messages to a PST file?

Copy the .mbox or .emlx out of Apple Mail onto the Windows PC, add them and start. The apple mail to pst converter writes a PST that Outlook mounts as a data file.

### How do I convert an email to PST format?

Keep it inside an .mbox or save it as an .emlx. Load the file, and the Apple Mail to PST converter packs the message into a PST together with its attachments.

### Is a free EML to PST converter available for Apple Mail?

Yes. The package installs the free trial of the paid program, so you can test the .emlx and .mbox conversion on your own mail before paying for a license.
